{"id":"3ff729913d04ca3e","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-prop-ordinal-successor.md","title":"Ordinal Successor","display":"prop-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-ordinal-successor","aliases":["58-prop-ordinal-successor"],"display":"prop-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-successor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-ordinal-successor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-ordinal-successor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45f08db7cdccaf0b\" href=\"?note=45f08db7cdccaf0b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-successor.md\">../batch16/58-df-successor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"45f08db7cdccaf0b\" href=\"?note=45f08db7cdccaf0b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-successor.md\">../batch16/58-df-successor.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)=\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)=\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the usual ordinal-addition notation, this same object is written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1\">\\(\\alpha+1\\)</span>; that notation is kept out of the formal assertion because the upstream atom defines the successor operator directly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-successor.md","status":"resolved","id":"45f08db7cdccaf0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-successor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-successor.md","status":"resolved","id":"45f08db7cdccaf0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-successor.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Succ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha)=\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha+1","display":false}],"bytes":829,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3984","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-prop-ordinal-successor.md|58-prop-ordinal-successor]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","45f08db7cdccaf0b"]}